    <string name="banner_sub">Tiled grid containers, 10-bit &amp; HDR included · RAW/DNG, AVIF, JPEG, PNG · App by N3 Vibecode</string>
    <string name="banner_tap">Tap for details</string>
    <string name="welcome_head">Welcome to N3 Gallery</string>
    <string name="welcome_body">★ Open iPhone screenshots &amp; HEIC/HEIF ★\nMost galleries fail on Apple HEIF containers: screenshots and iPhone photos are stored as tile grids (e.g. 8 × 6 tiles of 512 px), often 10-bit or HDR. N3 Gallery ships its own HEIF decoder (libheif) – images open just like on iPhone, tile by tile.\n\nAlso included:\n• RAW/DNG (CR2/CR3, NEF, ARW, ORF, RW2, RAF …) via the embedded camera preview\n• AVIF, JPEG, PNG, WebP, GIF, BMP, TIFF, HEVC video\n• Timeline grouped by day, tags &amp; albums, views by format and folder\n• Full EXIF, sensor, GPS and XMP display\n• Write notes &amp; tags straight into the image file (EXIF/XMP)\n• Grid with 2–32 columns: "+"/"−" in the timeline or pinch with two fingers\n• Group the timeline by day, month or year (chips at the top)\n• Zoom in the full-screen view: pinch up to 6×, double tap = 2×</string>
    <string name="welcome_footer">App by N3 Vibecode · Everything offline, no account, no cloud</string>
    <string name="welcome_ok">Let\'s go</string>
