    <!-- About -->
    <string name="about_text">N3 Gallery- Open HEIF iPhone Screenshots %1$s\n\n★ iPhone screenshots &amp; HEIC/HEIF ★\nThe app opens Apple HEIF containers with tile grids (e.g. 8 × 6 tiles), 10-bit, 12-bit and HDR images – even where the Android system decoder fails. libheif (HEVC) is built right into the app.\n\nA gallery app that displays practically every photo format: JPEG, PNG, WebP, GIF, BMP, TIFF, HEIC/HEIF (incl. Apple screenshots, 10-bit HDR and gain-map HEIF), AVIF, DNG and all common RAW formats (CR2/CR3, NEF, ARW, ORF, RW2, RAF, PEF, SRW …) via the embedded camera preview.\n\n• Timeline grouped by day\n• Tags/albums with filter chips\n• Views by file format and folder\n• Full EXIF, sensor, GPS and XMP display\n• Notes write real EXIF/XMP metadata into the file\n\nNo internet, no cloud, no accounts. Everything stays on the device.\n\nApp by N3 Vibecode</string>
    <string name="legal_no_liability">Legal notice: this app is provided free of charge and without any warranty. No liability is accepted – in particular not for data loss or any damage arising from the use of the app. Use at your own risk.</string>
